{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-06",
  "title": "痛覺相連",
  "storyCode": "10-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d0ca86de3a204aaa964ff7c07dc69fd266850643ad08bb559b4cfa6fff4bfb27",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將你所見的這座城市印入腦海。\n每建起一座新的高樓，都必然伴隨著無數舊屋的倒塌，而正是這些堆積數百年的塵灰，壘成了今日的倫蒂尼姆。\n當你繼承了這片土地，你不會只繼承了你能見到的華麗皮毛，你也必須將覆於其下的瘡疤全盤接受。\n要在這一排屋舍中建起一座新的房屋，是一件非常困難之事。\n你的眼睛需要洞穿皮肉，見到脊骨，來找到支撐起整座城市的最堅實的地基。\n這將會是你的起點。\n維娜，當你忘卻所有需要你繼承之物，你才能成為合格的繼承人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推進之王，請再考慮一下我的諫言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們必須離開這裡，離開這幽暗無光的地下洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "躲在地下的只有膽小的磐蟹與蟲豸。我實在無法忍受在這裡躲藏度日，放任我們的敵人在地上肆虐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我真的聽夠了你的怪腔調。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些站出來反抗薩卡茲的兄弟姐妹，哪個不是有血性的好戰士？他們要是貪生怕死，早就老老實實去給薩卡茲賣命了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要誤會，我沒有在怪他們。但是......他們的能力有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼能力有限？當初你半死不活地逃出倫蒂尼姆，是誰把你救了回來？你那時候怎麼不說我們能力有限呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不想跟你吵架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒跟你吵架，我就是不想慣著你這臭脾氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年多以前，你剛撞上我們的時候，我和摩根就跟你說過了，要和我們待在一塊，你首先得丟掉那些狗屁貴族做派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可得說句公道話，達格達挺努力的，她變化很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在誰見了她，能一眼就認出來她曾經是貴族騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，你們教會了我......不少東西。你們都很清楚，我早就把自己當作了格拉斯哥幫的一分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我們已經回到倫蒂尼姆，我沒法忘記，我同時還是一名塔樓騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你別以為回了倫蒂尼姆，情況就不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道有多少人在盯著維娜嗎？我們從來沒有安全過。不，就是因為回來了，才更危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一點我們意見一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是出於對安全性的考慮，我才認為我們更應當離開這些身份不明的武裝人士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達，你的意思是，你擔心反抗軍對維娜不利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的人員組成......很混雜。萬一有人包藏禍心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你覺得我們該去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我所知，仍有一些可靠的人留在城內。他們是我母親的故友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔樓騎士出事時情況緊急，我沒能及時聯絡他們，但我判斷......眼下是不錯的時機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的意思是，要我們去投奔貴族？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為是誰害死了維娜的父親，把她逼到街頭躲藏了這麼多年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為......是誰一路追殺，把我們逼出了倫蒂尼姆，害得貝爾德她們生死未卜？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年貴族們......或許各有想法，但後來薩卡茲就來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......你以為我們的敵人只有薩卡茲？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽好了，騎士小姐，你想讓我把維娜送去給那些陰險的貴族老爺，你得先有本事拿走我的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......漢娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做什麼？你弄出這麼大聲響，是想讓所有人都知道維娜是誰嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都給我冷靜一下。打架並不總能解決問題，尤其還是在這個節骨眼上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在想清楚你們說的話會帶來什麼後果之前，先閉上你們的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是想讓維娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......維娜？你......你怎麼想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，達格達的顧慮是有道理的。雖然我們跟著阿米婭和博士一起走到了這裡，但我們......我們的目的到底不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們只需要阻止這城裡的薩卡茲就好，這一點正是反抗軍在做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得，我們的目標是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摩根，因陀羅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初你們認我做首領，為的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......格拉斯哥幫想在倫蒂尼姆活下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時我們年紀都太小，又惹了太多事。有很多混混盯著我們，甚至還有幾個壞警察經常來找我們麻煩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，你比我們都要厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你教會了我，只會揮拳頭的人不是好老大。你帶領我們趕走了麻煩，還把更多人拉入了夥，讓格拉斯哥幫一點點變強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是因為這個，我才堅信你一定是個好主子，未來你也會是個很好的領袖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很好。這樣看來，我們都沒忘記最初的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們聽到那名......反抗軍指揮官說的話了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們要救倫蒂尼姆，在這之前，他們要救人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰能說我們的目標不一致？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的錘子是為了這座城市......為了維多利亞而造出來的。假如我的力量能救下哪怕一名維多利亞人，我也沒有理由不留在這片戰場上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......我不會再向您提起類似的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。我想說的是，你也沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如你有自己的使命想要去完成，你不必非得聽我的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是一名出色的騎士，但你的頭銜並非由我冊封。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不是你生來就必須效忠的領主。不......你該找到你真正想要效忠之物，而不是被血脈中的誓言約束。你從來都是自由的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......推進之王？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，這是不是太......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達她也不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都別再說了。我的想法，你們都聽清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達格達，我會等你做出選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了，推進之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛維希婭指揮官，關於我們的合作提案，您考慮好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......我可以叫你阿米婭吧？也請你直接叫我克洛維希婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......當然，克洛維希婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，你和{@nickname}博士已經解釋清楚了來意。我沒有理解錯的話，羅德島是一家......致力於解決感染者問題的製藥企業？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去你們確實和一些城市乃至國家有過合作......我也知道，大部分薩卡茲都是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......阿米婭，我還是想再確認一下，你們來倫蒂尼姆，也是出於同樣的動機嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，羅德島的業務中也包括解決薩卡茲問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......薩卡茲並不是問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛維希婭，我們眼前的薩卡茲與維多利亞人的戰爭才是問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這場戰爭中流的血已經足夠多了，無論那是維多利亞人的血，還是薩卡茲的血......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如戰爭進一步擴大，接下來又會發生什麼？還有多少人、多少國家會被捲入其中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不能任由這樣的慘劇發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，你的理想......很高尚。你是感染者，你想為感染者而戰，這很好理解......但你和薩卡茲有什麼關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我的理想繼承自一位薩卡茲。她是薩卡茲，可她愛著身為卡特斯的我，也愛著所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而羅德島......羅德島正是誕生於她的情感之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島為感染者、為薩卡茲，也為所有受壓迫者而戰。因為我們清楚，在任何一場爭鬥中，這些人往往都會被那些嚴酷的上位者所忽視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論羅德島有多少不得不與高高在上的人做的交易，我們的視線都不會從真正需要我們的人身上移開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚴酷的上位者......是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。阿米婭，我能體會到你的感受，也很尊重羅德島的理念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......我也希望你明白，自救軍與羅德島不同。自救軍的戰士們出身於不同的階層，有著各種理念，但我們戰鬥的目標只有一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們想要奪回倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們無法確認羅德島會一直站在我們一邊，即便你能說服我，我也無法說服我的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們會站在一起。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}博士......這算是一種承諾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們需要的並非承諾。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你們需要的是羅德島的行動。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我承認。你們也都看見了，自救軍人手有限。我們沒有辦法再為你們分散力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島絕不會拖自救軍的後腿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你誤會了，阿米婭。我們之中的很多人擔憂的絕不是你們不夠強大——甚至可能恰好相反。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的目標太遠大，而你們也看見了，自救軍還需要躲藏在城市的夾縫中，在一場一場戰鬥中爭取存活的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若你們真正想要的，是一場更宏大的戰爭，而戰場只是恰好在倫蒂尼姆的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你覺得僅憑羅德島，能戰勝城內的薩卡茲嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "只有站在同一起跑線上的，才有資格競逐控制權。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}博士，你如此坦誠，這讓我稍有一些意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這是在向我承認，雖然你們暫時無力與薩卡茲軍抗衡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但等到時機成熟，羅德島的目標的確是奪走那位暴虐的攝政王的權柄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們眼前的目標比你想的更明確。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你大可以當作我們想攻入中央城區。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "支持一支願意合作的武裝力量，不虧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（在來之前，我們不是這麼說的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，她是軍事指揮官。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "政客看到的是籌碼。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "商人聞到的是利益。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "而將軍需要更多力量。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是我們常用的換取協作的方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......博士說得對。就和任何時候一樣，我們渴望結束戰爭，卻也從來不逃避戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛維希婭，我們的目標是明確的。羅德島和自救軍一樣，會堅持戰鬥到成功阻止薩卡茲攝政王的那一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島會為自救軍提供應急藥品。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可露希爾已在與你們的工程師合作。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "羅德島還有其他表現誠意的方式。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "而下一次行動，羅德島會展示力量。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "克洛維希婭指揮官，你是否滿意？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......{@nickname}博士，你和阿米婭是很好的搭檔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來費斯特說的沒錯。你們就是我們一直在等待的幫手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在我和所有大隊長面前為你們做了擔保。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那剛才那些問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他還年輕，有勇氣站出來，卻未必做好了擔負後果的準備。這些責任由我來承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛維希婭......你也很年輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，但我是大家的指揮官呀。阿米婭，換作是你，你也會這麼做吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我知道的，你想再聽一次我們的說法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，希望你別介意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我怎麼會介意？我和博士都很高興......我們找到了很好的夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "克洛維希婭是優秀的指揮官。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "自救軍很厲害。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "謝謝費斯特。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}博士，我聽費斯特描述過你，但你還是......出乎了我的意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等負責偵察的戰士們回來，我們可以一起制定行動計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這將是一次救援行動，你們的幹員應該很有經驗吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很期待與羅德島的合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，我們的人收到了戈爾丁女士傳來的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴聯絡人，我們馬上就到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......能聯絡上信使就好了，沒有她的話，我們真的很難找到監獄的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，但願這趟能有些進展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你和費斯特怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都聽到你們吵架了。自從我們組了小隊，你們就跟左手和右手似的，配合得特別好。我從沒見過你們吵得那麼厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他和我在意的事情不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不說清楚怎麼知道不一樣？你啊，你早就該跟他說說以前的事了。雖說他平時老一心撲在鑽研技術上，但他會聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你為什麼要跟上來？沒想到你除了焊東西之外，還惦記著處理人際關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，焊什麼不是焊？你們都是好戰士，我早把你們當成自家弟弟和妹妹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......注意左邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......差一點。這街上怎麼多了這麼多雇傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲急著抓住我們。洛克五號......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......洛克五號看到了聯絡人，就在麵包店前面。走吧，我幫你看著雇傭兵的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老比爾，幫我把這塊部件給哈默哥送去，他在加固運糧車的時候一定能用上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扳手遞我一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有弗蘭克的盾牌，我又幫他調整了下表層塗料，這下肯定能防火了。但你記得提醒他，這東西被高溫烤久了還是容易裂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......你這塗料用的技術早就被淘汰啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不要試試看雷神工業的最新配方啊？貴是貴了點，但我們工程部搞出了個廉價版本，你們感興趣的話可以打折哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸欸燙！好燙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，戴有洞的隔熱手套，你真是工程師嗎？工程師的手難道不是最值錢的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嶄新的手套可是奢侈品，哪能說用就用啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說了，我哪知道你會突然冒出來，你不冒出來，我的手可是很穩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼神也不太好嘛，這明明也是工程師十項必備素質之一啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，這都得怪老比爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不知道他去哪了，平時只有他會站我旁邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，我來的時候，看到有一隊人跟著你那副隊長走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那傢伙......不是說好了要來幫我忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很擔心他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛走得很急，我還沒來得及看一眼洛克五號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我擔心早上那場混戰會影響無人機性能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......如果心裡裝著別的事，做出來的東西品質可不牢靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們能做的事情就是這些，做好了，他們在上面才能更安全不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈哈，沒想到羅德島的工程師這麼會安慰人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，說什麼呢，我在羅德島上可是王牌心理顧問，就連凱爾希......我很凶的頂頭上司都經常來找我說心裡話排解壓力哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，趕緊把扳手拿來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快開始幹活啦！怎麼，你還想讓我再多說幾個笑話才能打起精神嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬上就會有更多激烈的戰鬥，我們工程幹員可是砥柱中的砥柱，這麼多愁善感可不行啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈，好的，幹活幹活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，那個無人機......洛克十七給我看一眼。它缺一個飛行穩定模組，我從被打壞的寶貝上拆了一個下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，這可以嗎？沒有什麼專利問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓，小聲點，我可是背著Dr.{@nickname}偷偷拆下來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道賺大了還愣著幹嘛？扳手遞我一下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你說什麼？你見到戈爾丁女士了？她怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了，這個消息必須立刻傳給指揮官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！有、有敵人！我們暴露了，洛洛，快撤退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去找隊長，我們在尤斯頓路發現了反抗軍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這什麼東西？嗡嗡嗡的......無人機？我知道了，早上在出入口的人也是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛克五號——！怎麼回事，攻擊偏了......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道是因為沒有校準......剛才也沒有看到敵人......呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲林，別以為你還能得手。那群跟著王庭混的士兵會被這種東西暗算，我們可不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，你的無人機是不是壞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒關係，就算沒有無人機，我也還能戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖......竟然能傷到我。你的源石技藝和你的勇氣一樣，還算夠看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會和隊長說，讓你死在這裡。你可以不必去那座工廠，這樣會更痛快些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，你快走吧！這裡我來頂住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我們要走一起走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你得把戈爾丁女士的消息傳回去......！指揮官必須知道......知道......那位信使......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這條消息......非常重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信......指揮官......也相信你和費斯特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽我的，別、別再吵架了。我們都是......一家人。當時你爸爸......你爸爸也是這樣擋著薩卡茲，我們才能逃掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳！好大的煙......這人居然帶著榴彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷了我們好幾個人，你也別想活！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......隊長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他帶回去，和其他反抗軍關在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，這人為了炸我們，自己受了重傷，活不了多久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他也不用活太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，我知道了，將軍的意思，對吧？那其他人要追嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，別抱太大希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
